<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Chemopetrol CZK 522.4 mln Q1 gross profit.</title>
<headline>Czech Chemopetrol CZK 522.4 mln Q1 gross profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for quarter ending March 31, 1997: (in millions crowns)</p>
<p> gross profit	 522.438   vs     532.75</p>
<p> sales		4,600.00    vs   3,800.00</p>
<p>Note. Full company is Chemopetrol Group a.s., a petrochemical processor and by-products manufacturer. The company's refining operations were divested at the end of 1995 as part of the privatisation of Czech refineries.</p>
<p>The company has forecast full-year gross profit of 877.5 million crowns on revenues of 16.54 billion. Net profit for the quarter was not released.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
